{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and grab nearby object, take it, check properties and complete task, move to destination. Scan area, idle otherwise. list of available nodes: <Action ID = FindObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = DoTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = Idle    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectNearby    />",
